"the Template heading to sort by template. Select all the qubes based on the "
"old template by clicking on the first one, holding shift, then clicking on "
"the last one. With multiple qubes selected, right-click on any of them, "
"hover your cursor over Template, then click on the new template. Or in the "
"``System`` menu select ``Manage templates for qubes``, select any qubes "
"using the old template and update them to the new template using the drop "
"down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/templates.rst:188 89791e261cc241cfba1df3ad0afe5ccf
msgid ""
